<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Wednesday, slaughter steers and heifers sold $0.50 to 1.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1075-1350 lbs 63.00-64.50. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1350 lbs 61.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 62.00-63.40. Select and Choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 60.00-62.00. Package Select 2-3 1136 lbs 58.00.</p>
</text>
